# Chattera

Chattera is a simple and modern chat-based application built using Firebase.
The goal of this project is to provide a clean, fast, and real-time chatting experience.

## Features
- Real-time messaging
- Firebase Authentication
- Firebase Hosting support
- Scalable and secure architecture

## Tech Stack
- Firebase
- JavaScript
- HTML & CSS

